```
Where "finished" → stale (if there's an open claim, the ending would have closed it; the ending is the release). "running" → fresh. "unknown" (the run id cannot be resolved, or the API read failed) → fall back to timer: the claim is older than `LOCK_STALE_FALLBACK_MINUTES`.

